      "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The enigmatic conspiracist is targeted by a melee Strike or touch spell</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> With an uncanny look, the enigmatic conspiracist Demoralizes the creature that targeted them. Demoralize loses the auditory trait and gains the visual trait, and the conspiracist doesn't take a penalty if the creature doesn't understand their language. If the Intimidation check critically succeeds, the conspiracist disrupts the triggering action.</p>",
